Kill !!netMyDataDemo

Setup Form !!netMyDataDemo Size 70 22 Dialog
  Title 'My Data'
  Button .addMyData1 At X 2 Y 1 'Add to My Data' Call '!this.addMyData1Click()' Width 18
Exit

Show !!netMyDataDemo

Define Method .addMyData1Click()
import 'MyDataAddin'
handle (1000,0)
  -- Assembly already loaded
endhandle
using namespace 'Aveva.Core.Presentation.MyDataAddin'
if (BADREF(!!CE)) then
  $p Select a database element first.
  return
endif
!myData = object PMLMyData()
!elementName = !!CE.name
!myData.AddElement(!elementName)
$p Added to My Data: $!elementName
Endmethod
